Love seeing Dads and their 2.0s fight together in the gloom, working together to get 1% better. There is no excuse if you have kids to take the opportunity to incorporate working out within the family time- its free, its peer led, its leadership at its finest-  its F3 Dads.

21 Pax showed up for F3 Dads and crushed it! Most kids these days don't get up on Saturdays to workout yet ours do! You want to spend 2quality time with your kids- Show up to F3 Dads. You want to see what you kid can do when you push them in a healthy way- show up to F3 Dads. You want to workout harder because you are competing against and with warrior kids willing to put in the work- show up to F3 Dads. You want some quality time with your kids while you M gets quality rest time in the morning?- show up to f3 dads!

We did however had an injury on the field while doing an exercise so thoughts and prayers for s 2.0  Yoshi and his Arm/Wrist
Reach out and check on D-20s 2.0 if you get a chance to! Yoshi is a beast and one of the hardest workers out there!


