WOW WOW WOW!!! What an absolutely incredible, beautiful/Humid morning it was at The Spillway as we celebrated 3 milestones (The Spillway 3 YR/MKT 1YR/North Katy Launch)! 189 Men (Including 13 FNGs) (and Men from multiple Regions and AOs - MKT/North Katy/NoHo/soon to be Northwest Passage/Katy/Richmond/Fort Bend/West Houston/FTX/LTX/Aggieland) beat the 💩 out of their IB and came out to put some work in and fellowship with BOTG!  

First of all I want to thank each and everyone that showed up yesterday to help us celebrate! It was such an amazing day with a great group of HIM!  It is because of people like you that F3 is so freaking special - as we say so often: “Leave no man behind and leave no man where you found him!" What a simple yet powerful credo we live by everday in the gloom! At the end of the day, we don'tt come to F3 for us, we come to be better versions of ourselves for those we love the most and the ones that count on us to be better husbands, fathers, brothers, sons and friends! 

This is such an incredible brotherhood and im so blessed to be a part of this leadership movement!  Don't keep this amazing gift to yourself - keep giving it away and never stop accelerating! Unleash that God given purpose locked inside of you and go make a difference👊

