Form same 2 lines across from partner and mosey around where we came to the hill at the top of the hill. Same partner teams.

Thang 2: Bernie Lunges
Same partner teams 1 Bernie sanders up with 5 SSHs and run back down to your partner who is doing lunges until hand is tagged then swap. 5 sets each.

Back into formation partner lines to mosey around down the stairs and at the base of the hill by the amphitheater.

Thang 3: bear crawl star jumps
Same partners- 1st partner bear crawls up the hill until the concrete pad and crawl bear backwards( harder challenge was to turn and bear crawl back down) until hand tagging your partner who is doing start jumps until ragged. 5 sets each

Once the 6 was in everybody raced up the hill to the concrete sidewalk as a final dash. Got back ti into partner lines formation did 2 10 counts and headed back to the tables where originally started. 

Thang 4: frisbee dash
Two random teams( big frisbee and little frisbee)
Each team has to cycle through each member to throw the frisbee as far as possible down the field marked and back. Everyone in the group has to throw it once and when the sprint to get the frisbee is complete each time the group does 5 burpee/or air squats before next member takes a turn throwing. Once the final member throws the frisbee and it lands. Complete the last set of burpee/aur suqats and then the entire team sprints together back up to the top of the hill to the water.
Water break and cinder block tipping ensue!

